{"type":"item.completed","item":{"id":"item_48","type":"mcp_tool_call","server":"fetch","tool":"fetch","arguments":{"max_length":18000,"raw":false,"start_index":0,"url":"https://www.politifact.com/truth-o-meter/promises/biden-promise-tracker/?ruling=true"},"result":{"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Contents of https://www.politifact.com/truth-o-meter/promises/biden-promise-tracker/?ruling=true:\n### Stand up for the facts!\n\nOur only agenda is to publish the truth so you can be an informed participant in democracy.\n  \nWe need your help.\n\n[More Info](/membership/)\n\nThe Biden Promise Tracker monitors the 99 most important campaign promises of President Joseph R. Biden, elected in November 2020. Biden said his top priorities were fighting the coronavirus, improving the economy, responding to calls for racial justice and combating climate change. For each campaign promise, our reporters research the issue and then rate it based on whether the promise was achieved: Promise Kept, Promise Broken, Compromise, Stalled, In the Works or Not Yet Rated. We rate the promise not on the president's intentions or effort, but on verifiable outcomes. We previously tracked the promises of [President Donald Trump](https://www.politifact.com/truth-o-meter/promises/trumpometer/?ruling=true) and [President Barack Obama](https://www.politifact.com/truth-o-meter/promises/obameter/?ruling=true).\n\n## Biden Promise Tracker Scorecard\n\n## Top 5 Promises\n\n#### [Get COVID-19 under control](/truth-o-meter/promises/biden-promise-tracker/promise/1517/get-covid-19-under-control/)\n\n#### [Joe Biden](/personalities/joe-biden/)\n\n\"I’m never going to raise the white flag and surrender. We’re going to beat this virus. We’re going to get it under control, I promise you. \"\n\n#### Biden Promise Tracker\n\n![](https://static.politifact.com/promise-groups-meters/BidenCroppedHeadshot01142021.jpg)\n\nPromise Kept\n\n## Latest Biden Promise Tracker Promises\n\n![](https://static.politifact.com/CA